{"id":"n37153-2-6","stage":4,"title":"쩔쩔매다 · 诚惶诚恐","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n37153-2-6-1","ko":"넌 여자 친구에게는 왜 그렇게 쩔쩔매냐?","zh":"你为什么对女朋友就会那么手足无措呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"넌","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"넌","audio":"/audio/6a4a5bffadc879e8d8ac.mp3"}},{"text":"여자","meaning":"女性（여자 친구 合指“女朋友”）","explanation":"여자：女性（여자 친구 合指“女朋友”）。","readings":[{"term":"여자","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27369","senseId":"3","lemma":"여자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여자","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3"}},{"text":"친구에게는","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구에게는","audio":"/audio/003239597407649417d8.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"쩔쩔매냐?","meaning":"诚惶诚恐，惟命是从","explanation":"쩔쩔매다：诚惶诚恐，惟命是从；냐：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"쩔쩔매다","audio":"/audio/d29c86768b0607278e00.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37153","senseId":"2","lemma":"쩔쩔매다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쩔쩔매냐","audio":"/audio/c499ffa68ce9da0e967e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"3109db6ce062c863","term":"여자","zh":"女性（여자 친구 合指“女朋友”）","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3","entryId":"27369","definition":"女性（여자 친구 合指“女朋友”）","pronunciation":["여자"]},{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"d29c86768b060727","term":"쩔쩔매다","zh":"诚惶诚恐，惟命是从","audio":"/audio/d29c86768b0607278e00.mp3","entryId":"37153","definition":"被他人或事情压迫而不知所措，直不起腰来。","pronunciation":["쩔쩔매다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f8f507e8898d70b8ca82.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n37153-2-6-2","ko":"쩔쩔매다니, 그냥 내가 져 주는 거야.","zh":"什么手足无措，我只是让着她而已。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"쩔쩔매다니,","meaning":"诚惶诚恐，惟命是从","explanation":"쩔쩔매다：诚惶诚恐，惟命是从；다니：对得知的内容表示惊讶、感叹，并连接后文。","readings":[{"term":"쩔쩔매다","audio":"/audio/d29c86768b0607278e00.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37153","senseId":"2","lemma":"쩔쩔매다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쩔쩔매다니","audio":"/audio/196789fd9e848fa67042.mp3"}},{"text":"그냥","meaning":"就那样","explanation":"그냥：就那样。","readings":[{"term":"그냥","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36241","senseId":"1","lemma":"그냥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그냥","audio":"/au